"Allow the unmounting of shares that were mounted by other users. Please "
"think before you enable this option."
msgstr ""
"Permitir desmontar as propiedades montadas por outros usuarios. Na maioría "
"dos casos son precisos privilexios de superusuario para facelo. Pénseo antes "
