#. i18n: file: core/smb4k.kcfg:238
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ForceUnmountInaccessible), group (Shares)
#: rc.cpp:290
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Use super user privileges to force the unmounting of (inaccessible) shares"
